125],"v":[175277700,327606200,212013000,65370700,24173200,8676700,8568300,25582300,10951100,6589700,3822100,4434200,3486700,3372800,3050400,21653000,3933200,3437700,3374400,1913900,1406100,880800,3231000,6820100,3804200,1636100,2483000,1101100,617700,1034600,3904200]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.sbhmarine.com","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":314,"city":"Kuala Kurau","summary":"SBH Marine Holdings Berhad, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, trades in, and exports frozen seafood products in Malaysia, Turkey, Taiwan, Korea, Italy, France, Australia, Asia, and Europe. It processes and sells wild caught, farmed, and imported frozen seafood products, including black tiger, vannamei, and cat tiger shrimps, as well as squid, cuttlefish, and octopus. The company also engages in merchant trading of frozen processed seafood products; distribution and trading of aquaculture related products, such as shrimp feed, post larvae, probiotics, and test kits; and aquaculture shrimp farming operations. In addition, it is involved in the trade, import, and export of various marine products; shrimp hatchery and nursery center business; and provision of management services. The company was formerly known as Fantastic Holdings Berhad and changed its name to SBH Marine Holdings Berhad in March 2023. SBH Marine Holdings Berhad was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Kuala Kurau, Malaysia.","zh":"SBH Marine Holdings Berhad 成立于 2000 年，总部位于马来西亚 Kuala Kurau，前身为 Fantastic Holdings Berhad，于 2023 年 3 月更名。公司及其子公司在马来西亚、土耳其、台湾、韩国、意大利、法国、澳大利亚、亚洲及欧洲等地从事冷冻海产品的制造、贸易与出口业务。","lines":["冷冻海产品加工与销售：加工并销售野生捕捞、养殖及进口的冷冻海产品，包括黑虎虾、南美白对虾、猫虎虾以及鱿鱼、墨鱼和章鱼，客户为上述地区的海产品买家。","冷冻加工海产品贸易：从事冷冻加工海产品的商业贸易，面向相关市场的客户。","水产养殖相关产品分销与贸易：分销和贸易虾饲料、虾苗、益生菌和检测试剂盒等水产养殖相关产品，客户为水产养殖业者。","对虾养殖业务：开展水产对虾养殖运营。","海洋产品贸易与配套服务：从事各类海洋产品的贸易、进出口，经营虾苗孵化场和育苗中心业务，并提供管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Frozen seafood processing and sales: processes and sells wild caught, farmed, and imported frozen seafood products, including black tiger, vannamei, and cat tiger shrimps, as well as squid, cuttlefish, and octopus, to seafood buyers in the listed regions.","Merchant trading of frozen processed seafood: engages in merchant trading of frozen processed seafood products for customers in relevant markets.","Aquaculture-related product distribution and trading: distributes and trades aquaculture-related products such as shrimp feed, post larvae, probiotics, and test kits to aquaculture operators.","Aquaculture shrimp farming: operates aquaculture shrimp farming operations.","Marine products trading and support services: trades, imports, and exports various marine products, operates shrimp hatchery and nursery center business, and provides management services."]}}